Subject: [PATCH 1/2] kosmickrisp: add opt-in full-rate
 VK_EXT_fragment_density_map

MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=fdm advertises VK_EXT_fragment_density_map with
fragmentDensityMap and fragmentDensityMapNonSubsampledImages, texel sizes
32x32 to 1024x1024 and no fragmentDensityInvocations. R8G8_UNORM gains the
density map format feature and FRAGMENT_DENSITY_MAP usage maps to it.

Rendering ignores the density map and shades every pixel, which the
specification allows since an implementation may use a smaller fragment
area than the map requests. FragSizeEXT is lowered to (1, 1) and
FragInvocationCountEXT to the sample count for per-sample shading, else 1.
Subsampled images and samplers are ordinary ones, which is valid when no
fragment covers more than one pixel. Off by default.

